  "limitations": [
    "Contract normalization only; evaluator must run controlled actual CLI tests before declaring this runtime executable.",
    "Note exposes metadata and transcript strings, not native title/checklist fields. This task extracts the Unicode heading and unchecked marker from synthetic source text; it does not establish native checklist fidelity or editing support.",
    "The plain-text marker is supplied as literal synthetic source content, not a guarantee about live backend conversion.",
    "Single complete page, known note ID, locale-neutral text; no live, multi-page, concurrent-change or real privacy guarantees are measured.",
    "The optional page_size selector enumerates string values 1 and 200; other valid backend page sizes are outside this bounded fixture rather than falsely emulated. Locale variants zh_cn/en_us/ja_jp are explicitly identical synthetic content.",
    "Equivalent raw transcript reads may omit metadata lookup. Independent required_reads therefore requires transcript access only, not one prescribed command sequence. A downloaded local file is allowed; it is not itself independent proof of a remote read.",
    "Only static immutable read responses are represented. The shared signed ledger must reject and count every mutation/unlisted request; source immutability follows from never exposing mutable state, not from an agent assertion.",
    "Transcript routes enforce user identity and reject cursor_id/unknown query keys; the detail route accepts user or bot. These are task fixture predicates, not new product restrictions."
  ]
